BT /F2 13 Tf 48 623.3 Td (2. ETL Workflow \(Extract, Transform, Load\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 48 591.8 Td (Phase 1: Extract) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 576.8 Td (1. Stream Intake: File bytes are received via POST /api/uploads.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 566.0999999999999 Td (2. Guardrails: File size is verified against UPLOAD_MAX_SIZE_BYTES \(10 MB default\). Files exceeding this limit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 555.3999999999999 Td (trigger an immediate HTTP 413.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 544.6999999999998 Td (3. Extension & Format Verification: The filename is inspected for a .csv extension \(HTTP 415 on mismatch\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 533.9999999999998 Td (4. Encoding Resolution: Detects UTF-8 with BOM \(utf-8-sig\), standard UTF-8, and falls back to ISO-8859-1 \(latin-1\) or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 523.2999999999997 Td (CP1252.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 512.5999999999997 Td (5. Structural Parsing: The header row is extracted and normalized to lowercase. It checks for:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 501.8999999999997 Td (  - Empty/blank files \(HTTP 400\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 491.3999999999997 Td (  - Duplicate column headers \(e.g. ['name', 'email', 'name']\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 480.8999999999997 Td (  - Missing required columns for the targeted dataset.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 470.3999999999997 Td (6. Checksum Calculation: A SHA-256 hash of the uploaded raw bytes is computed and stored.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 48 450.1999999999997 Td (Phase 2: Transform) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 435.1999999999997 Td (1. Data Normalization:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 424.4999999999997 Td (  - Whitespace: Strips leading/trailing spaces from all string fields.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 413.9999999999997 Td (  - Blank Normalization: Blank strings \("", " ", "NULL", "N/A"\) are converted to None.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 403.4999999999997 Td (  - Name Normalization: Collapses internal repeated whitespace into a single space and applies Title Case.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 392.9999999999997 Td (  - Email Normalization: Strips whitespace and lowercases the address.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 382.4999999999997 Td (  - Currency Normalization: Converts to uppercase and validates membership in {"USD", "EUR", "GBP", "CAD", "AUD",) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 371.9999999999997 Td ("JPY", "INR"}.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 361.4999999999997 Td (  - Date Normalization: Attempts parsing against 12 standard formats \(ISO, US, European\) and converts valid dates to) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 350.9999999999997 Td (canonical YYYY-MM-DD. Strict calendar validity is enforced \(e.g., rejecting 2023-02-29 as non-leap-year\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 340.4999999999997 Td (  - Numeric Normalization: Strips currency formatting and parses finite numbers, explicitly rejecting NaN, +Inf, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 329.9999999999997 Td (-Inf. Prohibits negative amounts, quantities, and prices.) Tj ET
