BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 308.7999999999997 Td (  - Evaluates each record against all validation rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 298.2999999999997 Td (  - Preserves multiple error diagnostics per row \(e.g., a row with both an invalid email and a missing date receives) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 287.7999999999997 Td (distinct error records\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 277.2999999999997 Td (  - Original un-sanitized values and raw row JSON are preserved for auditability.) Tj ET
