BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 231.59999999999974 Td (  - All valid clean records are staged for bulk insertion into the respective domain table \(customers, sales, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 76 221.09999999999974 Td (inventory\).) Tj ET
