BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 526.1999999999994 Td (* Render Web Service: In the free tier, Render automatically spins down services after 15 minutes of inactivity. When) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 515.4999999999993 Td (a new incoming request arrives, a cold start of 30-50 seconds occurs. Because database state is persisted on Neon and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 504.79999999999933 Td (files are stored on Neon Object Storage, zero data is lost across spindowns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 494.09999999999934 Td (* Neon PostgreSQL & Object Storage: Neon provides free-tier storage and compute hours more than sufficient for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 483.39999999999935 Td (thousands of CSV processing jobs. Both relational records and raw uploaded files reside in the same project and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.2 Tf 58 472.69999999999936 Td (region \(Singapore / ap-southeast-1\), minimizing network hops and avoiding third-party egress overhead.) Tj ET
